# This repository is PUBLIC. Nothing secret and nothing the assignment forbids
# committing may be tracked here. hw4/.gitignore covers the project itself; these
# patterns protect the repository root, where the data pack is meant to be unpacked.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# The assignment forbids committing the database or the product images. They may be
# unpacked inside hw4/ or beside it, so both names are ignored at this level too.
data/
data hw4/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
products/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
